          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHY WE MADE IT",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>We created Bodology\u2122 Inositol Powder to give women a cleaner, simpler choice. Unlike mass brands or male-led supplements, Bodology\u2122 is female-led, <a href=\"/pages/meet-our-experts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Meet Our Experts\">practitioner-backed</a> and built by women who\u2019ve lived through PCOS, fertility struggles, and hormonal imbalances.</p><p>That's why we don\u2019t add fillers or extras that interfere with other supplements or prenatals and why every ingredient is intentional, including our carob-sourced D-Chiro Inositol for its natural origin, bioavailability, antioxidant profile, and smoother taste. </p>",
            "page": "",
