            "b1_enable": true,
            "b1_icon": "expert",
            "b1_title": "Expert Reviewed",
            "b1_sub": "RD \u2022 MS \u2022 PhD",
            "b1_hide_mobile": false,
            "b1_tip": "<p>Bodology's formula and label are reviewed by qualified professionals \u2014 including a <strong>Registered Dietitian (RD)</strong> and advisors holding <strong>MS and PhD</strong> credentials \u2014 so the ingredients, doses, and claims are accurate and responsibly stated.</p>",
            "b2_enable": true,
            "b2_icon": "flask",
            "b2_title": "Third Party Tested",
            "b2_sub": "",
            "b2_hide_mobile": false,
            "b2_tip": "<p>Bodology is tested independently \u2014 we don't grade our own work. Every production batch is sent to <strong>Certified Laboratories</strong>, an ISO/IEC 17025-accredited testing lab, and analyzed against written specifications before it can be sold. ISO/IEC 17025 is the international standard for laboratory competence and data integrity.</p>",
            "b3_enable": false,
            "b3_icon": "fingerprint",
            "b3_title": "Identity Verified",
            "b3_sub": "HPLC Analytical Testing",
            "b3_hide_mobile": false,
            "b3_tip": "<p>We use <strong>HPLC analytical testing</strong> to confirm the identity of each active \u2014 verifying that what's in the tub is genuinely myo-inositol and D-chiro-inositol, not a substitute or mislabeled material.</p>",
            "b4_enable": true,
            "b4_icon": "chart",
            "b4_title": "Potency Confirmed",
            "b4_sub": "",
            "b4_hide_mobile": true,
            "b4_tip": "<p>HPLC confirms that each batch contains <strong>myo-inositol and D-chiro-inositol at the labeled amounts</strong> \u2014 and that the 40:1 ratio is correct in the finished powder, not only in the formula. Because the two are isomers, HPLC separates and measures each one individually.</p>",
            "b5_enable": true,
            "b5_icon": "shield",
            "b5_title": "Heavy Metal Tested",
            "b5_sub": "",
            "b5_hide_mobile": false,
            "b5_tip": "<p>Every batch is tested for heavy metals by <strong>ICP-MS</strong> \u2014 arsenic, cadmium, mercury, and lead \u2014 and must fall within established safety limits before release. ICP-MS detects these metals down to trace levels, well below the limits set for dietary supplements.</p>",
            "b6_enable": true,
            "b6_icon": "microbe",
            "b6_title": "Microbial Safety Tested",
            "b6_sub": "",
            "b6_hide_mobile": false,
            "b6_tip": "<p>Every batch is screened for microbial safety: total aerobic count, total yeast and mold, and the absence of specified pathogens \u2014 <strong>E. coli, Salmonella, Staphylococcus aureus, and Pseudomonas aeruginosa</strong>. A batch only ships if it meets every limit.</p>",
            "b7_enable": true,
            "b7_icon": "ratio",
            "b7_title": "Clinically Studied Ratio",
            "b7_sub": "",
            "b7_hide_mobile": false,
            "b7_tip": "<p>The <strong>40:1 ratio</strong> of myo-inositol to D-chiro-inositol is the ratio used in published clinical research. We confirm this ratio in the finished powder by HPLC, so it matches the studied formulation.</p>",
            "b8_enable": true,
            "b8_icon": "pin",
            "b8_title": "Blended in the USA",
            "b8_sub": "",
            "b8_hide_mobile": false,
            "b8_tip": "<p>Bodology is <strong>blended, filled, and packaged in the United States</strong>.</p>"
          }
