        "expert_1": {
          "type": "expert",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Tina Kozman, CNP",
            "title": "Metabolic Health Coach",
            "blurb": "<p>Tina Kozman is a Certified Nutrition Practitioner, Life Coach, and Certified Metabolic Coach specializing in thyroid conditions, hormone imbalances, and sustainable weight loss. As Bodology\u2019s in-house metabolic health expert, Tina helps women understand the root causes behind hormonal and metabolic challenges\u2014like insulin resistance and muscle loss\u2014while guiding them toward natural, lasting solutions such as inositol supplementation. Her science-backed, compassionate approach empowers individuals to take control of their metabolic health and feel confident in their bodies again.</p>"
          }
        },
        "expert_2": {
          "type": "expert",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Dr. Anita W., Ph.D",
            "title": "Natural Medicine Practitioner",
            "blurb": "<p>Dr. Anita W\u0105sik, PhD, DipHM, is a renowned Biomedical Scientist and Medical Herbalist, with deep roots in academic research and herbal medicine. Her expertise in holistic health and women\u2019s well-being offers unique insight into evidence-based approaches to metabolic support, including inositol for weight and hormone balance. Dr. Anita is committed to objective, research-driven advice and holds no monetary ties to Bodology products.</p>"
          }
        },
        "expert_3": {
          "type": "expert",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Leslie Kutcha, FDNP",
            "title": "Functional Diagnostic Nutrition Practitioner",
            "blurb": "<p>With over 100,000 followers across TikTok and Instagram, Leslie Kutcha is a widely respected voice in women\u2019s health and founder of Nourished With Leslie. A Certified Functional Diagnostic Nutrition Practitioner (FDNP), Certified Strength and Conditioning Specialist (CSCS), and Certified Personal Trainer (CPT) with a B.S. in Nutrition, Leslie specializes in women\u2019s hormone health, gut dysfunction, and fertility support, using advanced lab testing and personalized protocols to uncover the root causes of imbalance. At Bodology, Leslie advises on clinical messaging and educational content\u2014ensuring our science is both accessible and actionable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "expert_4": {
          "type": "expert",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Hillary Wright, RD",
            "title": "Director of Nutrition at Boston IVF",
            "blurb": "<p>Hillary Wright is the Director of Nutrition at the Wellness Center at Boston IVF, one of the nation\u2019s oldest and largest fertility clinics. With over three decades of experience as a registered and licensed dietitian, Hillary plays a crucial role in helping countless individuals and couples navigate their fertility journeys through optimal nutrition and metabolic health. Hillary\u2019s influence extends to her authorship of three groundbreaking books: \u201cThe PCOS Diet Plan,\u201d \u201cThe Prediabetes Diet Plan,\u201d and \u201cThe Menopause Diet Plan.\u201d These publications, coupled with her clinical experience, have solidified Hillary\u2019s reputation as an expert in the intricate relationship between nutrition, metabolic health, and fertility.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
